\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 \u8220 When she speaks, she speaks for me,\u8221  Biden said, noting her past work as California's attorney general makes her specially equipped to lead the administration's response.}{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}
